.TH PAPERWEIGHT\-GRUB\-THEME 8 "2026-06-19" "paperweight-grub 0.1.7" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
paperweight\-grub\-theme \- switch the PaperweightOS GRUB theme variant
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B paperweight\-grub\-theme
.I variant
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B paperweight\-grub\-theme
activates a Catppuccin color variant for the PaperweightOS GRUB2 theme
by replacing the active
.I theme.txt
with the named variant file and running
.BR update-grub (8).
.PP
The change takes effect on the next boot.
If the requested variant is already active, the command exits without
running
.BR update-grub .
.PP
Must be run as root.
Normally invoked automatically by
.BR paperweight-theme (1)
when the user has sudo privileges.
.SH VARIANTS
.TP
.B macchiato
Catppuccin Macchiato (default)
.TP
.B latte
Catppuccin Latte (light)
.TP
.B frappe
Catppuccin Frappé
.TP
.B mocha
Catppuccin Mocha
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR paperweight-theme (1),
.BR update-grub (8)
